/-
# Constant texts of `CBSTM03A` (generated by `gen_text.py` from the IR)

The `HTML-FIXED-LN` condition values and the `STATEMENT-LINES` / `HTML-LINES` fillers, as
CP037 text (`ebc`, the front end's encoding of literals), each with its bytes
(`…_lit`, checked by the kernel).  `ConstsOk m`: the fillers hold their `VALUE`s in storage
`m`, read in the maximal constant runs of each line (the reads the program makes).
-/
import Cobol
open Cobol

namespace Cobol.StmCore

/-- Text in the program's character set (CP037). -/
def ebc (s : String) : List UInt8 := (Codepage.encode037 s).getD []

/-- `n` spaces. -/
